e design,daily quote generator,inspirational quote AI\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://meigenai.org\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Meigen AI — AI Quote Studio\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Generate original quotes and turn them into brand-ready visual cards with Meigen AI. 20+ templates, batch export, multi-platform sizes. Free to try.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://meigenai.org\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Meigen AI\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://meigenai.org/og-image.jpg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Meigen AI — Turn Ideas into Shareable Quotes in 30 Seconds\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Meigen AI — AI Quote Studio\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Generate original quotes and turn them into brand-ready visual cards with Meigen AI. 20+ templates, batch export, multi-platform sizes. Free to try.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://meigenai.org/og-image.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0x3dzn~oxb6tn.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0c0c0e] text-[#f5f0e8]\"><div class=\"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-24\"><a class=\"inline-block mb-12 text-sm text-[#a09b94] hover:text-[#d4a853] transition-colors\" href=\"/\">← Back to Home</a><h1 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold mb-8\">Terms of Service</h1><p class=\"text-[#a09b94] mb-12\">Last updated: May 12, 2026</p><div class=\"space-y-10 text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\"><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p>By accessing or using Meigen AI (&quot;the Service&quot;), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">2. Description of Service</h2><p>Meigen AI is an AI-powered quote generation and visual card creation tool. We provide templates, text generation, and export capabilities for personal and commercial use subject to these terms.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">3. User Accounts</h2><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\"><li>You must provide accurate information when creating an account.</li><li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li><li>You must be at least 13 years old to use the Service.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">4. Acceptable Use</h2><p>You agree not to:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-2\"><li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose or to violate any laws.</li><li>Generate content that is harmful, threatening, abusive, harassing, defamatory, or discriminatory.</li><li>Attempt to interfere with or disrupt the Service or its infrastructure.</li><li>Resell, redistribute, or scrape the Service or its outputs at scale without authorization.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">5. Intellectual Property</h2><p><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">Your content:</strong> You retain ownership of any text, logos, or brand assets you upload. You grant us a limited license to use these solely to provide the Service.</p><p class=\"mt-2\"><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">AI-generated quotes:</strong> <!-- -->Quotes generated by our AI are provided on an &quot;as-is&quot; basis. We do not guarantee originality or uniqueness. You are responsible for verifying that generated content does not infringe third-party rights before commercial use.</p><p class=\"mt-2\"><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">Templates:</strong> Our template designs and software are owned by Meigen AI and licensed to you for use within the Service.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">6. Subscriptions and Payments</h2><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\"><li>Pro and Team plans are billed in advance on a monthly or annual basis.</li><li>You may cancel at any time. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period.</li><li>Refunds: first-time purchases qualify for a 7-day refund if you&#x27;ve used less than 20% of your monthly quota.</li><li>We reserve the right to change pricing with 30 days&#x27; notice.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2><p>The Service is provided &quot;as is&quot; without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee that AI-generated quotes are accurate, original, or suitable for any particular purpose.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">8. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Meigen AI shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">9. Termination</h2><p>We may suspend or terminate your account if you violate these Terms. You may delete your account at any time from your Account Settings.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">10. Changes to Terms</h2><p>We may update these Terms from time to time. We will notify you of material changes via email or through the Service. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">11. Contact</h2><p>For questions about these Terms, email<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:support@meigenai.org\" class=\"text-[#d4a853] hover:underline\">support@meigenai.org</a>.</p></section></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0yu3k-pmkudgf.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[86402,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ka051yepewro.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n13:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/15g6f3-b9zkmm.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700\\u0026family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700\\u0026family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500\\u0026display=swap\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"terms-of-service\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,